{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>YHWH is strength</b> — the sense of למו is 'to my helpers,' for the Name is strength to the helpers and a stronghold to the helped, and he is His anointed, David. And R. Moses said: עוז למו is like לו, like נגע למו. This is not correct, for למו returns to 'the servant of YHWH' and to His people."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:48.933262464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}